<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through Christ’s incarnation God came into man,</l><l>And through crucifixion came redemption’s plan;</l><l>Then in resurrection, the Comforter came,</l><l>And in His ascension exalt His name!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>It is God’s good pleasure to show us the Son,</l><l>And through His dispensing we are all made one;</l><l>Through this life abundant and rich life supply,</l><l>The church will be builded and beautified.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
